config:
  theme: neutral
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as 用户
  participant FE as Web SPA
  participant API as Gateway API
  participant ENG as CanvasRouteEngine<br/>(内存索引)
  participant DB as 数据库

  Note over U,DB: 简化后：deploy = 保存画布即可

  U ->> FE: 点击部署
  activate FE

  FE ->> API: PUT /api/canvas-state<br/>{ graph: Node[], edges: Edge[] }
  activate API

  API ->> DB: UPSERT canvas_states<br/>(graph + name + enabled + priority)
  DB -->> API: ok

  API ->> ENG: subscribeToCanvasChanges 回调<br/>→ rebuild 内存索引
  ENG -->> API: rebuild 完成

  API -->> FE: 200
  deactivate API

  FE -->> U: 部署成功

  deactivate FE

  Note over FE,DB: 收益：<br/>1. deploy = 1 次 HTTP 请求（PUT /api/canvas-state）<br/>2. 运行时引擎订阅变更自动重建索引，O(1) 查询<br/>3. 单一数据源，事务原子性，零同步复杂度<br/>4. GET /api/model-routes 在运行时热路径不再触发
